## 💡 Example usage (from serial terminal or Python GUI)

| Command          | Effect                                     |
| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------ |
| `START`          | Start DE5 adaptive control loop            |
| `STOP`           | Stop motor and PWM                         |
| `PI 0.03 0.0015` | Set Kp = 0.03, Ki = 0.0015                 |
| `W 0.4 0.4 0.2`  | Update weighting: torque, efficiency, temp |
| `ROW 3`          | Manually select DE5 row 3                  |
| `STREAM ON`      | Start telemetry streaming                  |
| `STREAM OFF`     | Stop telemetry                             |
| `MORPH 1000 1`   | Set morph cooldown = 1s, step size = 1 row |

All replies come back in CSV-like form (easy to parse by Python or GUI):

```
ACK,PI,0.030000,0.001500
ACK,START
```

