## 🧠 Integration

You can now:

1. Drop this file alongside `de5_control.c/h`.
2. Call `uart_cmd_feed(rx_byte)` from your UART ISR or polling loop.
3. Adjust PI controller **in real time** without reflashing the MCU.
4. Use the existing **Python serial GUI** to add a slider or text input for PI tuning (one line change).

